<title>USA: AMEX to list 54 new long-term options on May 19.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list 54 new long-term options on May 19.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Stock Exchange said Friday it would add the January 2000 LEAPS (Long-term Equity Anticipation Securities) series to 54 stocks on May 19.</p>
<p>Among the new options will be January 2000 LEAPS on shares of American Express Co, Amgen Inc, BellSouth Corp, Walt Disney Co and Intel Corp.</p>
<p>Also included will be Motorola Inc, Procter &amp; Gamble Co, Reebok International Ltd and Warner-Lambert Co.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
